{%- comment -%}
  Footer, apple.com global-footer style. Light gray (scheme-2) by default,
  held to --content-max like the navigation, small type throughout:
  1. Footnotes first: the brand disclaimer, 12px muted, then a hairline.
  2. Directory: one column per block (link lists, contact, text, newsletter);
     12px/600 headings, 12px links with a 24px line pitch (a 32px hit
     area with a mouse, 44px rows on touch). Below 750px the
     link, contact and text columns become accordions (<olivet-accordion>,
     12px headings with a plus that turns into ×, 44px rows, hairlines).
     The newsletter stays open: a compact field with a small pill inside it.
  3. Brand line: the merchant's own logo (snippets/brand-logo.liquid, used
     intact; the light version on dark schemes) or the store name, the
     tagline, and small, muted social and payment icons.
  4. Legal row: copyright, policy links divided by thin bars, and the
     country / language selectors as small text buttons.
  Every colour is a scheme token, so any scheme works.

  Nothing appears twice (apple.com never repeats a footer link): with
  "Hide repeated links" on, a column leaves out links an earlier column
  already shows, the legal row leaves out policies a column already lists,
  and a column left empty is not rendered (the editor shows a hint).

  Accordion columns: the details are rendered open, so without JS every
  column is visible at every width. The inline script below closes them
  below 750px and reopens them above it (the summaries are hidden there and
  a static heading shows instead), so desktop keeps plain headings and a
  short tab order.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign year = 'now' | date: '%Y'

  comment
    Logo tone follows the scheme: a dark ground (scheme-3 Black and
    scheme-4 Graphite by default) asks brand-logo for the merchant's light
    version. The scheme's own background decides when it is known, so a
    re-coloured scheme still gets the right logo; otherwise the scheme id
    does. The selection is mirrored here only to size the image (width and
    height attributes, so nothing shifts); brand-logo makes the real choice.
  endcomment
  assign logo_tone = 'light'
  assign scheme_id = section.settings.color_scheme.id | default: section.settings.color_scheme
  assign scheme_bg = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background
  if scheme_bg != blank
    assign scheme_brightness = scheme_bg | color_brightness
    if scheme_brightness < 128
      assign logo_tone = 'dark'
    endif
  elsif scheme_id == 'scheme-3' or scheme_id == 'scheme-4'
    assign logo_tone = 'dark'
  endif

  assign logo_height = section.settings.logo_height | default: 28
  assign footer_logo = section.settings.logo
  if footer_logo == blank
    if logo_tone == 'dark'
      assign footer_logo = settings.logo_inverse
      if footer_logo == blank and settings.logo_dark_safe
        assign footer_logo = settings.logo | default: shop.brand.logo
      endif
    else
      assign footer_logo = settings.logo | default: shop.brand.logo
    endif
  endif
  assign logo_width = logo_height | times: 4
  if footer_logo != blank and footer_logo.aspect_ratio > 0
    assign logo_width = footer_logo.aspect_ratio | times: logo_height | ceil
  endif
  if logo_width > 240
    assign logo_width = 240
  endif

  comment
    Directory pass. Repeated links: a link whose URL an earlier column
    already shows is dropped (tokens "|block:index|" in keep). A column with
    nothing to show is skipped outside the editor. Grid tracks from 990px:
    one per rendered block, the newsletter weighted so the inline field has
    room and the contact column so a street address stays on one line;
    with fewer than four blocks, empty tracks fill the row so the columns
    keep their directory width and pack to the left instead of stretching.
    750-989px: the columns share one row (cols_md: 3 or 4 tracks), the
    newsletter takes the row below.
  endcomment
  assign dedupe = section.settings.hide_repeated_links
  assign seen = '|'
  assign keep = '|'
  assign skipped = '|'
  assign cols = ''
  assign cols_md = 0
  assign n_tracks = 0
  assign has_contact = false
  if settings.brand_email != blank or settings.brand_phone != blank or settings.brand_address != blank
    assign has_contact = true
  endif

  for block in section.blocks
    assign has_content = true
    case block.type
      when 'link_list'
        assign kept = 0
        for link in block.settings.menu.links
          assign url_token = '|' | append: link.url | append: '|'
          if dedupe and seen contains url_token
            continue
          endif
          assign seen = seen | append: link.url | append: '|'
          assign keep = keep | append: block.id | append: ':' | append: forloop.index0 | append: '|'
          assign kept = kept | plus: 1
        endfor
        if kept == 0
          assign has_content = false
        endif
      when 'text'
        if block.settings.text == blank
          assign has_content = false
        endif
      when 'contact'
        assign has_content = has_contact
    endcase

    unless has_content or request.design_mode
      assign skipped = skipped | append: block.id | append: '|'
      continue
    endunless

    assign n_tracks = n_tracks | plus: 1
    case block.type
      when 'newsletter'
        assign cols = cols | append: ' minmax(0, 1.6fr)'
      when 'contact'
        assign cols = cols | append: ' minmax(0, 1.2fr)'
        assign cols_md = cols_md | plus: 1
      else
        assign cols = cols | append: ' minmax(0, 1fr)'
        assign cols_md = cols_md | plus: 1
    endcase
  endfor
  if n_tracks > 0 and n_tracks < 4
    assign fill = 4 | minus: n_tracks
    for i in (1..fill)
      assign cols = cols | append: ' minmax(0, 1fr)'
    endfor
  endif
  assign cols = cols | strip
  if cols_md > 4
    assign cols_md = 4
  elsif cols_md < 3
    assign cols_md = 3
  endif

  assign collapse = section.settings.collapse_on_mobile

  assign show_localization = false
  if section.settings.show_localization
    if localization.available_countries.size > 1 or localization.available_languages.size > 1
      assign show_localization = true
    endif
  endif

  assign show_payment = false
  if section.settings.show_payment_icons and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0
    assign show_payment = true
  endif

  assign show_social = false
  if section.settings.show_social
    assign networks = 'instagram,facebook,tiktok,youtube,pinterest,x' | split: ','
    for network in networks
      assign social_key = 'social_' | append: network | append: '_link'
      if settings[social_key] != blank
        assign show_social = true
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    Legal row: every policy the directory has not already listed.
  endcomment
  assign policy_count = 0
  assign policy_keep = '|'
  if section.settings.show_policies
    for policy in shop.policies
      if policy == blank
        continue
      endif
      assign url_token = '|' | append: policy.url | append: '|'
      if dedupe and seen contains url_token
        continue
      endif
      assign policy_count = policy_count | plus: 1
      assign policy_keep = policy_keep | append: forloop.index0 | append: '|'
    endfor
  endif

  assign show_brand = section.settings.show_brand_line
-%}

<footer
  class="footer color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} footer--padding-{{ section.settings.padding }}{% if collapse %} footer--collapse{% endif %}"
  id="footer-{{ section.id }}"
  role="contentinfo"
  data-footer
>
  <div class="page-width page-width--medium footer__inner">

    {%- comment -%} 1. Footnotes (apple.com puts them first) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if settings.brand_disclaimer != blank -%}
      <div class="footer__footnotes">
        <p class="footer__disclaimer">{{ settings.brand_disclaimer | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} 2. Directory {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if n_tracks > 0 -%}
      <div class="footer__directory" style="--footer-cols-md: {{ cols_md }};{% if cols != blank %} --footer-cols: {{ cols }};{% endif %}">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign skip_token = '|' | append: block.id | append: '|'
            if skipped contains skip_token
              continue
            endif

            assign heading = block.settings.heading
            if block.type == 'link_list' and heading == blank
              assign heading = block.settings.menu.title
            endif

            assign collapsible = false
            if collapse and block.type != 'newsletter' and heading != blank
              assign collapsible = true
            endif

            assign block_class = block.type | replace: '_', '-'
            assign heading_id = 'FooterHeading-' | append: block.id
          -%}

          {%- capture column_content -%}
            {%- case block.type -%}
              {%- when 'link_list' -%}
                {%- capture link_items -%}
                  {%- for link in block.settings.menu.links -%}
                    {%- assign link_token = '|' | append: block.id | append: ':' | append: forloop.index0 | append: '|' -%}
                    {%- if keep contains link_token -%}
                      <li>
                        <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="footer__link"{% if link.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ link.title | escape }}</a>
                      </li>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endcapture -%}
                {%- if link_items != blank -%}
                  <ul class="footer__links" role="list">{{ link_items }}</ul>
                {%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.menu.links.size > 0 -%}
                    <p class="footer__hint">{{ 'footer.repeated_hint' | t }}</p>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <p class="footer__hint">{{ 'footer.menu_hint' | t }}</p>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}

              {%- when 'text' -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <div class="footer__text">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
                {%- endif -%}

              {%- when 'contact' -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign phone_href = settings.brand_phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' | remove: '.'
                -%}
                {%- if has_contact -%}
                  <address class="footer__contact">
                    <ul class="footer__links" role="list">
                      {%- if settings.brand_email != blank -%}
                        <li><a href="mailto:{{ settings.brand_email | escape }}" class="footer__link footer__contact-line">{{ settings.brand_email | escape }}</a></li>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if settings.brand_phone != blank -%}
                        <li><a href="tel:{{ phone_href | escape }}" class="footer__link footer__contact-line">{{ settings.brand_phone | escape }}</a></li>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </ul>
                    {%- if settings.brand_address != blank -%}
                      {%- comment -%}
                        One line per address line; each comma-separated part
                        moves as a unit, so "Pkwy S," never breaks from its
                        street (same treatment as contact-form).
                      {%- endcomment -%}
                      {%- assign address_lines = settings.brand_address | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
                      <p class="footer__address footer__contact-line">
                        {%- for address_line in address_lines -%}
                          {%- assign address_parts = address_line | strip | split: ', ' -%}
                          <span class="footer__address-line">
                            {%- for address_part in address_parts -%}
                              <span class="footer__address-part">{{ address_part | escape }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}</span>{% unless forloop.last %} {% endunless %}
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </span>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </p>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </address>
                {%- endif -%}

              {%- when 'newsletter' -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign form_id = 'FooterNewsletter-' | append: section.id | append: '-' | append: block.id
                  assign input_id = form_id | append: '-email'
                  assign button_label = block.settings.button_label
                  if button_label == blank
                    assign button_label = 'newsletter.button_label' | t
                  endif
                -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <div class="footer__text">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- form 'customer', id: form_id, class: 'footer__newsletter-form' -%}
                  <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
                  {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
                    <p class="form-status form-status--success footer__status enter" id="{{ form_id }}-success" role="status" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
                      {%- render 'icon', name: 'success', size: 16 -%}
                      <span>{{ 'newsletter.success' | t }}</span>
                    </p>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <div class="footer__field{% if form.errors %} footer__field--error{% endif %}">
                      <label class="visually-hidden" for="{{ input_id }}">{{ 'newsletter.label' | t }}</label>
                      <input
                        id="{{ input_id }}"
                        type="email"
                        name="contact[email]"
                        class="footer__field-input"
                        value="{{ form.email | escape }}"
                        placeholder="{{ 'newsletter.placeholder' | t }}"
                        autocomplete="email"
                        autocorrect="off"
                        autocapitalize="off"
                        spellcheck="false"
                        inputmode="email"
                        enterkeyhint="send"
                        required
                        aria-required="true"
                        {% if form.errors %}
                          aria-invalid="true"
                          aria-describedby="{{ form_id }}-error"
                          autofocus
                        {% endif %}
                      >
                      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm footer__field-button" name="commit">{{ button_label | escape }}</button>
                    </div>
                    {%- if form.errors -%}
                      <p class="form-status form-status--error footer__status enter" id="{{ form_id }}-error" role="alert">
                        {%- render 'icon', name: 'error', size: 16 -%}
                        <span>{{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages.email }}</span>
                      </p>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endform -%}
            {%- endcase -%}
          {%- endcapture -%}

          {%- if collapsible -%}
            <olivet-accordion class="accordion footer__col footer__col--{{ block_class }} footer__group" data-footer-group {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <details id="FooterGroup-{{ block.id }}" open>
                <summary class="accordion__summary footer__group-summary">
                  <span class="footer__group-title">{{ heading | escape }}</span>
                  {%- render 'icon', name: 'plus', size: 14 -%}
                </summary>
                <h2 class="footer__heading footer__heading--static" id="{{ heading_id }}">{{ heading | escape }}</h2>
                <div class="accordion__content footer__group-content" data-accordion-content>
                  <div class="accordion__inner">
                    <div class="footer__group-body">{{ column_content }}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>
            </olivet-accordion>
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="footer__col footer__col--{{ block_class }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if heading != blank -%}
                <h2 class="footer__heading" id="{% if block.type == 'newsletter' %}{{ form_id }}-heading{% else %}{{ heading_id }}{% endif %}">{{ heading | escape }}</h2>
              {%- endif -%}
              {{ column_content }}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} 3. Brand line: small wordmark, tagline, social and payment icons {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if show_brand or show_social or show_payment -%}
      <div class="footer__brandline">
        {%- if show_brand -%}
          <p class="footer__brand">
            {%- comment -%} Not a link: the navigation already leads home {%- endcomment -%}
            <span class="footer__logo" style="--footer-logo-height: {{ logo_height }}px;">
              {%- render 'brand-logo', tone: logo_tone, override: section.settings.logo, width: logo_width, class: 'footer__logo-img', wordmark_class: 'footer__wordmark' -%}
            </span>
            {%- if settings.brand_tagline != blank -%}
              <span class="footer__tagline">{{ settings.brand_tagline | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_social or show_payment -%}
          <div class="footer__marks">
            {%- if show_social -%}
              {%- render 'social-icons', class: 'footer__social', size: 16 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if show_payment -%}
              <div class="footer__payment">
                <h2 class="visually-hidden">{{ 'footer.payment_methods' | t }}</h2>
                <ul class="footer__payment-list" role="list">
                  {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
                    <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'footer__payment-icon' }}</li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} 4. Legal row {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="footer__legal">
      <p class="footer__copyright">{{ 'footer.copyright' | t: year: year, shop: shop.name }}</p>
      {%- if policy_count > 0 -%}
        <nav class="footer__policies-nav" aria-label="{{ 'footer.policies' | t }}">
          <ul class="footer__policies" role="list">
            {%- for policy in shop.policies -%}
              {%- assign policy_token = '|' | append: forloop.index0 | append: '|' -%}
              {%- if policy != blank and policy_keep contains policy_token -%}
                <li class="footer__policy"><a href="{{ policy.url }}" class="footer__policy-link">{{ policy.title | escape }}</a></li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if show_localization -%}
        <div class="footer__localization">
          {%- render 'localization-form', id: 'FooterLocalization', variant: 'text' -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

{%- if collapse -%}
  <script>
    (function () {
      /* Footer columns: accordions below 750px, open columns above it. */
      if (window.OlivetFooter) {
        window.OlivetFooter.sync();
        return;
      }
      var mq = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 749px)');
      var setGroup = function (group, open) {
        var details = group.querySelector('details');
        var summary = details && details.querySelector('summary');
        if (!details || !summary) return;
        if (open) {
          if (typeof group.open === 'function') {
            group.open();
          } else {
            details.open = true;
            details.classList.add('is-open');
          }
        } else {
          details.open = false;
          details.classList.remove('is-open');
        }
        summary.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
      };
      var sync = function () {
        document.querySelectorAll('[data-footer-group]').forEach(function (group) {
          setGroup(group, !mq.matches);
        });
      };
      window.OlivetFooter = { sync: sync };
      if (mq.addEventListener) {
        mq.addEventListener('change', sync);
      } else if (mq.addListener) {
        mq.addListener(sync);
      }
      document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', sync);
      document.addEventListener('shopify:block:select', function (event) {
        var group = event.target.closest && event.target.closest('[data-footer-group]');
        if (group && mq.matches) setGroup(group, true);
      });
      sync();
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Footer",
  "class": "footer-section",
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["footer"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The disclaimer shown first in the footer, the tagline and the contact details are set in Theme settings → Brand."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Columns"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "collapse_on_mobile",
      "label": "Collapse columns on mobile",
      "info": "Below 750px, link, contact and text columns with a heading become accordions.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hide_repeated_links",
      "label": "Hide repeated links",
      "info": "A column leaves out links an earlier column already shows, and the policy row leaves out policies a column lists, so nothing appears twice.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Brand line"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_brand_line",
      "label": "Show logo and tagline",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "logo",
      "label": "Footer logo",
      "info": "Optional, shown as uploaded. Falls back to the theme logo (its light version on dark color schemes), then to the store name."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "logo_height",
      "label": "Logo height",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 28
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_social",
      "label": "Show social icons",
      "info": "Links are set in Theme settings → Social media. Networks without a link are hidden.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_payment_icons",
      "label": "Show payment icons",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Legal row"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_policies",
      "label": "Show policy links",
      "info": "Policies are managed in Settings → Policies.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_localization",
      "label": "Show country and language selectors",
      "info": "Appears only when more than one country or language is enabled in Markets.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "padding",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "options": [
        { "value": "compact", "label": "Compact" },
        { "value": "default", "label": "Default" },
        { "value": "airy", "label": "Airy" }
      ],
      "default": "default"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "name": "Link list",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading",
          "info": "Leave empty to use the menu's title."
        },
        {
          "type": "link_list",
          "id": "menu",
          "label": "Menu",
          "default": "footer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Text",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "<p>Handcrafted biblical anointing oils. Made in Richmond, Texas.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "contact",
      "name": "Contact",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "Contact"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "Email, phone and address come from Theme settings → Brand."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "newsletter",
      "name": "Newsletter",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "Letters from the studio"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "<p>New blends, notes from the Anointing Journal, and a word of encouragement now and then.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "button_label",
          "label": "Button label",
          "default": "Subscribe"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "Subscribers are added as customers tagged “newsletter”."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
